msgid "Check your understanding {#check-your-understanding-5}"
msgstr "Suriin ang iyong pagkaunawa {#check-your-understanding-5}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do you think it is better to make a shaded lightcone map before or after transpilation? Why?\n"
msgstr "Sa tingin mo, mas mabuti bang gumawa ng shaded lightcone map bago o pagkatapos ng transpilation? Bakit?\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "It must be done after transpilation. In order for these different maps to be useful we must make sure that the adjacent qubits in our circuit corresponded to adjacent qubits on our quantum chip. Otherwise, entangling gates shown as acting on the adjacent qubits in the circuit diagram would end up requiring SWAP gates and a more complicated circuit structure.\n"
msgstr "Kailangan itong gawin pagkatapos ng transpilation. Para maging kapaki-pakinabang ang iba't ibang maps na ito, kailangan nating siguraduhin na ang katabing qubit sa ating circuit ay tumutugma sa katabing qubit sa ating quantum chip. Kung hindi, ang mga entangling gate na ipinapakita na kumikilos sa katabing qubit sa circuit diagram ay mangangailangan ng SWAP gates at mas komplikadong circuit structure.\n"
